It's a feature (teleporting on a non-teleport level and following
you).
He's speed 18 so you can escape him by getting fast and/or by
something that might be called "stair dancing".  Circle around the
portal or down stairs.  When he's farther from the stairs than you
are step onto the stairs.  If there's a time he does not follow, step
down the stairs or step onto the portal.  If you can get your speed
to something other than 18 (12 is the human default) you can count
in a pattern and try at different points in the beat pattern.  This
beat
patterns system is also how you can walk away from slow monsters
doing hits and moves timed so they never get to swing at you.


